{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23955","headline":"戏和微之荅窦七行军之作 · 白居易","name":"戏和微之荅窦七行军之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旌钺从櫜鞬，宾僚礼数全。\n夔龙来要地，鵷鹭下辽天。\n赭汗骑骄马，青娥舞醉仙。\n合成江上作，散到洛中传。\n陋巷能无酒，贫池亦有船。\n春装秋未寄，谩道有闲钱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}